"<html><head/><body><p>The application '<span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">%1</span>' has requested to open the KDE wallet. This is used "
"to store sensitive data in a secure fashion. Please choose the new wallet's "
"type below or click cancel to deny the application's "
